# Phase lock

Read `GAME_SPEC.md` first. Implement only the Current Phase.

- Do not generate the whole game in one pass
- Do not start the next phase until the user confirms the current one works
- After a phase, report the 8-item checklist from GAME_SPEC.md
- Fastest meaningful target is Phase 7 (cable disconnect vertical slice)
- No extra accidents, maps, co-op, or juice-as-logic before their phase
- Keep ART_GUIDE.md. No new colors, no warning-text accidents, no glow/outline
